OL,3,GNEWSATree falls on two cars in church
OL,4,Acar park
OL,5,
OL,6,FA large tree has fallen on two parked
OL,7,Fcars in the car park of a church in
OL,8,FEastbourne.
OL,10,FWorkmen were at the scene and have been
OL,11,Fclearing the site at St Saviour's
OL,12,FChurch, a 19th Century building in
OL,13,FSouth Street, where pictures showed the
OL,14,Fuprooted tree lying across the vehicles
OL,15,Fon Wednesday.
OL,17,FThe trunk almost completely covered a
OL,18,Fblack car, with a wheel and the front
OL,19,Fpassenger door visible, while part of
OL,20,Fthe tree was resting on the top of a
OL,21,Fwhite car with part of its roof
OL,22,Fdamaged.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
