OL,3,GNEWSATree falls on two cars in church
OL,4,Acar park
OL,5,
OL,6,FEast Sussex Fire and Rescue Service
OL,7,Fsaid crews had not been called to the
OL,8,Fscene. The BBC has contacted the
OL,9,Fchurch, where the tree covered the
OL,10,Flength of the car park, for comment.
